      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `query_metric_window.py` that queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. Given the task requirements, I will use the Amazon CloudWatch service, which is a monitoring service for AWS cloud resources and applications. The integration will be identifiable by the use of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and by the specific client and method calls to CloudWatch. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
